OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of trees being planted in
OL,4,Apublic spaces
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has plans to plant hundreds
OL,7,Fof trees throughout over the winter in
OL,8,Fa bid to enhance the landscape and
OL,9,Fboost people's mental health.
OL,11,FTorridge District Council said it would
OL,12,Fplant up to 300 trees and 500ft (140m)
OL,13,Fof hedgerow at 14 places in Bideford,
OL,14,FEast-the-water, Northam, Holsworthy and
OL,15,FBradworthy.
OL,17,FMore than 25 different varieties will
OL,18,Fbe planted, with some set to replace
OL,19,Ffull grown trees reaching the end of
OL,20,Ftheir lives.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
