OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of trees being planted in
OL,4,Apublic spaces
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Peter Hames said trees play
OL,7,F"an invaluable role" for wildlife,
OL,8,Fcarbon capture and oxygen creation, and
OL,9,Fhelp create green spaces which have "a
OL,10,Fpositive impact on the physical and
OL,11,Fmental health of our residents".
